<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":| block =\n    | Heading : string\n    | Paragraph : string\n    | Code : string * string\n    | Terminal : string * string\n    | Table : list string * list (list string)\n    | Note : string\n    | Rule\n\n:= ^ cells (tag : string) (row : list string) : string =\n    ?= row ?|\n    | [] => \"\"\n    | cell :: rest => \"<\" ++# tag ++# \">\" ++# html.escape cell ++# \"</\" ++# tag ++# \">\" ++# cells tag rest\n\n:= ^ body_rows (rows : list (list string)) : string =\n    ?= rows ?|\n    | [] => \"\"\n    | row :: rest => \"<tr>\" ++# cells \"td\" row ++# \"</tr>\" ++# body_rows rest\n\n:= render_block (b : block) : string =\n    ?= b ?|\n    | Heading text => \"<h2>\" ++# html.escape text ++# \"</h2>\"\n    | Paragraph text => \"<p>\" ++# html.escape text ++# \"</p>\"\n    | Code (language, text) =>\n        := opening = \"<pre><code class=\\\"language-\" ++# html.escape language\n        := closing = \"\\\">\"\n        (opening ++# closing) ++# (html.escape text ++# \"</code></pre>\")\n    | Terminal (command, output) =>\n        \"<pre class=\\\"terminal\\\"><code><span class=\\\"prompt\\\">$ </span>\"\n        ++# html.escape command\n        ++# \"\\n\"\n        ++# html.escape output\n        ++# \"</code></pre>\"\n    | Table (head, rows) =>\n        \"<table><thead><tr>\" ++# cells \"th\" head ++# \"</tr></thead><tbody>\" ++# body_rows rows ++# \"</tbody></table>\"\n    | Note text => \"<aside class=\\\"note\\\">\" ++# html.escape text ++# \"</aside>\"\n    | Rule => \"<hr class=\\\"section-rule\\\">\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :| block =
      | Heading : string
      | Paragraph : string
      | Code : string * string
      | Terminal : string * string
      | Table : list string * list (list string)
      | Note : string
      | Rule

  := ^ cells (tag : string) (row : list string) : string =
      ?= row ?|
      | [] => ""
      | cell :: rest => "<" ++# tag ++# ">" ++# html.escape cell ++# "</" ++# tag ++# ">" ++# cells tag rest

  := ^ body_rows (rows : list (list string)) : string =
      ?= rows ?|
      | [] => ""
      | row :: rest => "<tr>" ++# cells "td" row ++# "</tr>" ++# body_rows rest

  := render_block (b : block) : string =
      ?= b ?|
      | Heading text => "<h2>" ++# html.escape text ++# "</h2>"
      | Paragraph text => "<p>" ++# html.escape text ++# "</p>"
      | Code (language, text) =>
          := opening = "<pre><code class=\"language-" ++# html.escape language
          := closing = "\">"
          (opening ++# closing) ++# (html.escape text ++# "</code></pre>")
      | Terminal (command, output) =>
          "<pre class=\"terminal\"><code><span class=\"prompt\">$ </span>"
          ++# html.escape command
          ++# "\n"
          ++# html.escape output
          ++# "</code></pre>"
      | Table (head, rows) =>
          "<table><thead><tr>" ++# cells "th" head ++# "</tr></thead><tbody>" ++# body_rows rows ++# "</tbody></table>"
      | Note text => "<aside class=\"note\">" ++# html.escape text ++# "</aside>"
      | Rule => "<hr class=\"section-rule\">"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### a_heading_is_escaped (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_block (Heading \"Async & DNS\") |> _assert_eq \"<h2>Async &amp; DNS</h2>\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_block (Heading "Async & DNS") |> _assert_eq "<h2>Async &amp; DNS</h2>"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### code_keeps_its_language (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_block (Code (\"spiral\", \"inl x = 1 < 2\"))\n|> _assert_eq \"<pre><code class=\\\"language-spiral\\\">inl x = 1 &lt; 2</code></pre>\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_block (Code ("spiral", "inl x = 1 < 2"))
  |> _assert_eq "<pre><code class=\"language-spiral\">inl x = 1 &lt; 2</code></pre>"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

