#### a_terminal_block_shows_the_command_and_its_output (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_block (Terminal (\"hyperfine 'spiral build'\", \"Time (mean): 1.2 s\"))\n|> _assert_eq (\n    \"<pre class=\\\"terminal\\\"><code><span class=\\\"prompt\\\">$ </span>hyperfine 'spiral build'\\n\"\n    ^^ \"Time (mean): 1.2 s</code></pre>\"\n)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_block (Terminal ("hyperfine 'spiral build'", "Time (mean): 1.2 s"))
  |> _assert_eq (
      "<pre class=\"terminal\"><code><span class=\"prompt\">$ </span>hyperfine 'spiral build'\n"
      ^^ "Time (mean): 1.2 s</code></pre>"
  )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

